   "key": "cubit_pi6",
   "title": "The royal cubit is π/6 of a metre",
   "wonder": "Divide π by six and you get 0.5236. That is the royal cubit in metres, a unit defined in France in 1791.",
   "measured": 0.523748,
   "target": 0.5235987755982988,
