   "title": "Four shafts aim at four stars",
   "wonder": "From the King's Chamber one shaft points at Orion's belt and one at the pole star of the age. From the Queen's Chamber, one at Sirius and one at the Little Dipper. All four, in the century the pyramid was built.",
